A: How do you say what you're thinking or talking about, in Russian? First, just listen: I ask Masha a question.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Ма́ша, о чём ты ду́маешь?
    draw think caption false

    draw pic_cat pic_work pic_sea parallel true

    ask "What is Masha thinking about? Listen for the last word, and tap the picture." listen "Я ду́маю о рабо́те." voice b gloss "I'm thinking about work." on ["pic_cat","pic_work","pic_sea"] correct 2
        right: Рабо́та: я ду́маю о рабо́те.
        wrong: Рабо́та: я ду́маю о рабо́те.

    erase pic_cat pic_work pic_sea think

A: Now the whole conversation, with the words.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: О means about. And after о, ма́ма has become ма́ме.
    highlight talk_5_words talk_6_words effect underline color #d0865f part ма́ме

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw p_mama a_mama p_rab a_rab

A: It's the е you know from в Москве́ and на рабо́те: о ма́ме, о рабо́те.
    highlight a_mama a_rab effect underline color #d0865f

B: Москва́, о Москве́: кни́га о Москве́.
    draw p_msk a_msk

A: A word that ends in a consonant just adds е: брат, о бра́те.
    draw p_brat a_brat

B: Careful: in lesson forty-five, a present went to бра́ту, with у. About him, it's о бра́те, with е.
    highlight a_brat effect underline color #d0865f part е$

A: Мо́ре already ends in е, so it stays: о мо́ре.
    draw p_more a_more

B: And a country in ия takes ии, as in lesson twenty-three: о Росси́и.
    draw p_ros a_ros

A: And before а, и, о, у or э, о becomes об: Ива́н, об Ива́не.
    draw p_ivan a_ivan

B: О ма́ме, о рабо́те, о Москве́, о бра́те, об Ива́не: after о, as after в and на, nearly always е.
    highlight a_mama a_rab a_msk a_brat a_more a_ros a_ivan effect underline color #d0865f

    erase p_mama a_mama p_rab a_rab p_msk a_msk p_brat a_brat p_more a_more p_ros a_ros p_ivan a_ivan

    draw q_chto q_ar1 q_ochom

A: To ask, что and кто change too: о чём,  (@draw q_kto q_ar2 q_okom@)about what, and о ком, about whom, for people and animals.

A: Ду́мать, to think, goes like чита́ть: я ду́маю, ты ду́маешь, она́ ду́мает.
    draw v1 v2 v3

B: And о follows your other verbs too: мы говори́м о Москве́.
    draw v5 v4

    erase q_chto q_ochom q_kto q_okom q_ar1 q_ar2 v1 v2 v3 v4 v5

    draw qi_mum

    quiz "Tom is thinking about his mum: Я ду́маю о … Which form?" reveal.text "Я ду́маю о ма́ме." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 270 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: О ма́ме: after о, the а makes way for е.
        wrong: After о, what does the а of ма́ма become?
        * ма́му
        * ма́ма
        + ма́ме

    erase qi_mum question_2_stamp

    draw qi_bro

    quiz "The answer is О бра́те. What was the question?" reveal.text "О ком? О бра́те." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 270 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: О ком: a brother is a who.
        wrong: Is a brother a what or a who?
        + О ком ты ду́маешь?
        * О чём ты ду́маешь?

    erase qi_bro question_3_stamp

    draw qi_book

    ask "A book about Moscow. Type the last word: кни́га о …" answer ["москве"] reveal.text "кни́га о Москве́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 270 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Москве́: the а makes way for е, as in в Москве́.
        wrong: Start from Москва́; after о, what does the а become?

    erase qi_book question_4_stamp

    draw qi_work

    ask "Masha's line from the conversation. Say it in Russian." say_it "Я ду́маю о рабо́те." gloss "I'm thinking about work." voice b show cue test t1

B: Я ду́маю о рабо́те.
    draw say_line

    erase qi_work say_line

    draw qi_talk

    ask "Build the sentence: We're talking about Russia. Type it in Russian." answer ["мы говорим о россии","говорим о россии"] reveal.text "Мы говори́м о Росси́и." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 270 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Мы говори́м о Росси́и: о, and ия becomes ии.
        wrong: Мы говори́м, then о, then Росси́я with lesson twenty-three's ending.

    erase qi_talk question_6_stamp

    draw recap parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap

A: So, to talk about something: о, and mostly е.
    draw sum

B: О Росси́и, об Ива́не.
    draw sum2

    erase sum sum2

A: Next time: мно́го and ма́ло, many and few.
    box next52 "Next: lesson 52 · мно́го книг" say "мно́го книг" x 500 y 430 width 620 height 120 radius 14 font_size 44

    erase next52

B: А ты? О чём ты ду́маешь? Пока́!
    draw end_masha end_q parallel true

